{"full":"intel/AI-Playground","name":"AI-Playground","description":"AI PC starter app for doing AI image creation, image stylizing, and chatbot on a PC powered by an Intel® Arc™ GPU.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":990,"forks":138,"created":"2024-07-10T19:26:08Z","updated":"2026-10-01T22:50:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.235Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.235Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.235Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:25.417Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:10.333Z","stars":990,"forks":138},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:32.235Z","stars":990,"forks":138}],"technologies":[],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:37.567Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to AI Playground open source project and AI PC generative AI application suite. This application provides a full suite of generative AI features for chat, image generation, video generation, code assistance, document search, image analysis, and more. Features can run offline on your PC’s Intel® Core™ Ultra with built-in Intel Arc GPU, Intel Arc™ dGPU Series A or B with 8GB+ of vRAM, or NVIDIA RTX GPUs—or you can optionally use Hybrid Cloud mode to run frontier models from providers such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok while you manage models, cost, and control of your data.","AI Playground is intended to act as an offline alternative to cloud tools such as Gemini, ChatGPT, and Grok. AI Playground leverages libraries from GitHub and Huggingface including:","As a local alternative to cloud AI services, AI Playground is intended to give consumers and AI curious prosumers easy and intuitive access to a wide variety of generative AI features using their Intel powered AI PC. This means you can be offline, without loading sensitive or personal data to 3rd party sites, for free, in a single app without having to know how to install and manage multiple AI backend frameworks. Key features:"],"features":["Image Diffusion (PyTorch): Stable Diffusion 1.5, SDXL, Flux.1-Schnell, Flux.1 Kontext[dev], Flux.2 Klein, Z-Image, ERNIE-Image, Wan 2.1/2.2, LTX-Video, LTX-2.3","LLM: GGUF (Llama.cpp Vulkan) - Gemma 4, Qwen3.5, Qwen3.6, Qwen3 VL, GPT-OSS 20B, DeepSeek R1 Distilled, Phi3, Mistral 7B, Llama 3.2: OpenVINO - TinyLlama, Mistral 7B, Phi3 mini, Phi3.5 mini, DeepSeek R1 Distill (1.5B,…","Chat Assistant: One preset for vision, reasoning, document RAG, tool calling, and MCP—run image, video, and editing workflows from chat when tools are enabled","Latest chat models: Gemma 4, Qwen3.5, Qwen3.6, Qwen3 VL, Mistral 7B, DeepSeek R1, GPT-OSS, and more via Llama.cpp or OpenVINO; browse, favorite, and download from the Model Manager (cylinder icon in the title bar)","Game Agent & Quick Coder: Agentic presets to create HTML games (plan, debug, play-test, and thumbnails with Game Agent; faster one-shot creation with Quick Coder)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"ddcd6021f65cfe440c2c56515fd66a59ff5b7737d08fa8c1c2728137de98f5d1","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:28:07.294Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:39.117Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T22:50:42Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Welcome to AI Playground open source project and AI PC generative AI application suite. This application provides a full suite of generative AI features for chat, image generation, video generation, code assistance, document search, image analysis, and more. Features can run offline on your PC’s Intel® Core™ Ultra with built-in Intel Arc GPU, Intel Arc™ dGPU Series A or B with 8GB+ of vRAM, or NVIDIA RTX GPUs—or you can optionally use Hybrid Cloud mode to run frontier models from providers such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok while you manage models, cost, and control of your data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Features can run offline on your PC’s Intel® Core™ Ultra with built-in Intel Arc GPU, Intel Arc™ dGPU Series A or B with 8GB+ of vRAM, or NVIDIA RTX GPUs—or you can optionally use Hybrid Cloud mode to run frontier models from providers such as ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and Grok while you manage models, cost, and control of your data.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Optional Hybrid Cloud backends connect to hosted models via your API keys.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Hybrid Cloud (optional): Use frontier models from top providers when you configure API keys in the Set Up wizard—local features still work without it","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"ddcd6021f65cfe440c2c56515fd66a59ff5b7737d08fa8c1c2728137de98f5d1","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:39.118Z"},"enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","latestRelease":{"name":"AI Playground Version v3.2.1 Beta","tag":"v3.2.1-beta","publishedAt":"2026-10-01T22:50:42Z","url":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/releases/tag/v3.2.1-beta"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:39:50.143Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/intel/AI-Playground/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T05:06:39.120Z","hash":"ddcd6021f65cfe440c2c56515fd66a59ff5b7737d08fa8c1c2728137de98f5d1","originalBytes":30470,"storedBytes":30470,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","card","install","playground","apache","run","proxy","build","license","intel","image","installation","gpu","installer","npm","bash","chat","instruct","models","sudo","app","appimage","apt","download","may","wh